# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Important\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  Every depth reported is on an abstract, fully connected register. Mapping to real hardware connectivity is a separate stage, and an occupation encoding’s per-mode qubit blocks give a router rather different structure to work with than one qubit per mode.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Penting\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  Semua depth yang dilaporkan berasal dari register abstrak yang terhubung penuh. Mapping ke konektivitas hardware nyata adalah tahap terpisah, dan blok qubit per mode pada occupation encoding memberi router struktur yang cukup berbeda dibandingkan satu qubit per mode.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

